  "releaseNotes": "- **Reads a taggregate's history for update asynchronously,** for Compze.Teventive.TeventStore's part of `ITaggregateStoreUpdater.GetForUpdateAsync`: `sp_getapplock` waits for the taggregate's lock holding no thread. Requires the Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Abstractions released with it.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Sql.MicrosoftSql 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.5.0-alpha), Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Abstractions 0.8.0-alpha (was 0.7.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
